          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>The Mystery of Her Reign's End</strong><br>\nThe latter part of Nefertiti's reign is shrouded in mystery. Some evidence suggests she may have ruled alongside Akhenaten and possibly alone after his death. There are also theories that she was the pharaoh Neferneferuaten, ruling before Tutankhamun, the boy king.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Nefertiti's Legacy</strong><br>\nNefertiti's legacy is a complex interweaving of political, religious, and artistic achievements. Her reign is noted for its artistic richness and the significant religious upheaval that she helped orchestrate. She remains a figure of intrigue and speculation, with her ultimate fate and burial place still unknown.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rediscovery and Impact</strong><br>\nThe rediscovery of Nefertiti's bust has had a lasting impact on both the historical understanding of the Amarna Period and popular culture. She has come to symbolize ancient Egypt's power and beauty, influencing fashion, film, and literature. Despite the loss of much of Amarna's history, her legend persists, inspiring countless generations with her story of beauty, power, and mystery.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
